STEP 5 — Wrap the registrations section + certificates IIFE in a conditional tab panel.
Wrap the existing <section id="registrations" className="dashboard-section"> ... </section> block AND the certificates IIFE block that follows it (lines 1971–2143) together in a single conditional:

  {activeTab === 'registrations' && (
    <>
      <div style={{ marginTop: -24 }}>
        <section
          id="tabpanel-registrations"
          role="tabpanel"
          aria-labelledby="tab-btn-registrations"
          className="dashboard-section"
        >
          {/* existing registrations content */}
        </section>
      </div>
      {/* CERTIFICATES IIFE — cut from after </section id="registrations"> and paste here */}
      {(() => {
        const certRegs = registrations.filter(
          (r) => r.attendanceStatus === 'present' && (r.eventId as EventItem)?.certificatesEnabled
        );
        if (certRegs.length === 0) return null;
        return (
          <section className="dashboard-section" style={{ marginTop: 8 }}>
            {/* existing certificates content unchanged */}
          </section>
        );
      })()}
    </>
  )}

Critical: the certificates IIFE at lines 1971–2143 (starting '{/*  CERTIFICATES SECTION  */}' and ending with '})()}') is CUT from its current position (after the registrations section's closing </section> tag) and PASTED inside the registrations fragment as shown above. The IIFE content itself is NOT changed. Change the registrations section's id from 'registrations' to 'tabpanel-registrations' and add role/aria-labelledby attributes.

STEP 8 — Upgrade filter chips to emoji + .filter-chip-lg.
Inside the events section, replace the existing inline chip array (the [{label, value}].map(...) block inside the <div className="filter-chips"> wrapper, around lines 627–645) with:

  {[
    { emoji: '🧩', text: 'All',       value: '' },
    { emoji: '⚡', text: 'Hackathon', value: 'hackathon' },
    { emoji: '💻', text: 'Tech',      value: 'tech' },
    { emoji: '🎤', text: 'Seminar',   value: 'seminar' },
    { emoji: '🎮', text: 'Games',     value: 'games' },
    { emoji: '🎬', text: 'Movie',     value: 'movie' },
    { emoji: '📦', text: 'Other',     value: 'other' },
  ].map((f) => (
    <button
      key={f.value}
      type="button"
      className={`filter-chip filter-chip-lg${typeFilter === f.value ? ' active' : ''}`}
      onClick={() => handleTypeChange(f.value)}
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">{f.emoji}</span> {f.text}
